  "trace_id": "staggered_regression",
  "description": "The staggered regressor: regression onset spread across corners over several laps rather than arriving synchronised. Under the de-qualification rule (two consecutive failures) no corner can flip earlier than one lap after its own onset, so a quorum collapse takes about two laps from the first onset here \u2014 which is the honest target eval plan v2 states, against the one-lap figure that only synchronised synthetic streams can achieve.",
